# Vaultwarden secrets. Copy to .secrets.env and fill in (workflow: README.md).
# .secrets.env is gitignored - never commit real values.

# Unlocks /admin (user management, invites, diagnostics). Generate an Argon2
# hash - Vaultwarden warns on plaintext tokens:
#   docker run --rm -it vaultwarden/server /vaultwarden hash
# Paste the whole `$argon2id$...` string as-is; env_file values are not
# interpolated by compose, so the `$` signs need no escaping here.
# Unset this variable entirely to disable the admin page.
ADMIN_TOKEN=REPLACE_ME
